{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"rg -n 'def parse_opencode_event|tool_call|tool_use|callID' bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py | head -65; sed -n '4860,4910p;5058,5095p;5118,5148p' bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py\"","aggregated_output":"296:    sanitize_tool_calls_list,\n322:def _normalize_tool_calls(\n328:    return sanitize_tool_calls_list(calls, schemas, **_SANITIZE_LIMITS)\n408:        \"\"\"Учесть tool_use/tool_call: pending/running — активен, иной статус — завершён.\"\"\"\n409:        if etype not in (\"tool_use\", \"tool_call\"):\n413:            part.get(\"callID\") or part.get(\"id\") or part.get(\"tool\") or \"tool\"\n512:                    self.has_tools = self.has_tools or bool(delta.get(\"tool_calls\"))\n562:# api.json (free, не deprecated, tool_call) со списком Zen и пишет state/zen-catalog.json; мост\n713:TOOL_CALL_OPEN = \"<tool_call>\"\n714:TOOL_CALL_CLOSE = \"</tool_call>\"\n715:# 2026-10-24: на opencode.ai/zen `<tool_call>` — нативный спец-токен GLM-5: апстрим вырезает блок\n716:# из text (токены при этом тарифицируются), а `<tool_call>` в прошлых репликах провоцирует модель\n727:    \"\"\"GLM-модели получают протокол на `<tool_invoke>`, а не на спец-токене `<tool_call>`.\"\"\"\n739:    \"\"\"Заменить `<tool_call>`-теги в промпте на `<tool_invoke>` для GLM; остальным — как есть.\"\"\"\n765:# (bash/read/edit/write/glob/grep). Отклонённый вызов переводим в tool_call DSH.\n987:def _native_to_tool_calls(\n1037:def _native_to_tool_call(\n1041:    calls = _native_to_tool_calls(tool, args, tools)\n1084:# Сырой вызов `<tool_call>{…` / `<tool_invoke>{…`: не inline-код markdown и не упоминание тега в прозе.\n1086:    r\"(?<!`)<(?:tool_call|tool_invoke)>\\s*(?:(?:```|~~~)\\w*\\s*)?\\{\"\n1094:# Намерение немедленного действия (преамбула шага без `<tool_call>`): явный глагол действия.\n1130:# Апстрим вырезал `<tool_call>…</tool_call>` из text, но токены в step_finish остались: столько\n1398:    \"\"\"Шаг без `<tool_call>`/`<tool_invoke>` оборвался или остановился на преамбуле — нужен повтор.\n3883:        return \"tool_use\", {\n3895:    \"\"\"Native serve-вызов в DSH-вызов через канонический _native_to_tool_calls (fit_args + multiedit).\"\"\"\n3902:    return _native_to_tool_calls(tool, args, list(tools or []))\n4436:    result[\"terminal\"] = \"tool_calls\"\n5136:                    emulate_tools and _split_tool_calls([\"\".join(result[\"texts\"])])[1]\n5143:                    result[\"terminal\"] = \"tool_calls\"\n5330:            _log(f\"tool_call_recovered extra_braces={extra}\")\n5380:def _normalize_tool_call(item: Any) -> dict[str, Any]:\n5381:    \"\"\"Один OpenAI tool_call -> {\"id\", \"name\", \"arguments\"}.\n5401:def _render_tool_call(item: Any) -> str:\n5403:    payload = json.dumps(_normalize_tool_call(item), ensure_ascii=False)\n5424:    # у GLM подстрока `tool_call` в промпте провоцирует нативный спец-токен\n5425:    block_name = \"tool_invoke\" if _uses_alt_tool_tag(model_id) else \"tool_call\"\n5466:    assistant.tool_calls и role:\"tool\" рендерятся в те же блоки, что протокол.\n5471:        call_id = str(msg.get(\"tool_call_id\") or msg.get(\"id\") or \"\")\n5480:        calls = msg.get(\"tool_calls\")\n5482:            parts.extend(_render_tool_call(tc) for tc in calls)\n5519:def _parse_tool_call_block(inner: str, *, quiet: bool = False) -> dict[str, Any] | None:\n5549:    \"\"\"`<tool_call>`/`<tool_invoke>` в inline-коде markdown (`` `<tool_call>` ``) — не тег.\"\"\"\n5558:def _split_tool_call_inner(inner: str) -> list[str]:\n5559:    \"\"\"Разбить содержимое блока по вложенным `<tool_call>`/`<tool_invoke>` вне строковых литералов JSON.\n5595:def _parse_tool_call_blocks(\n5604:    single = _parse_tool_call_block(inner, quiet=quiet)\n5609:    segments = _split_tool_call_inner(inner)\n5614:        call = _parse_tool_call_block(segment, quiet=quiet)\n5749:    `</tool_call>`) границей блока не является. Экранированные кавычки `\\\\\"`\n5817:                calls = _parse_tool_call_blocks(text[pos:end], quiet=True)\n5832:def _new_tool_call_parser(\n5833:    on_content: Callable[[str], None], on_tool_call: Callable[[dict[str, Any]], None]\n5838:        on_tool_call,\n5840:        parse_blocks=_parse_tool_call_blocks,\n5845:def _split_tool_calls(chunks: list[str]) -> tuple[str, list[dict[str, Any]]]:\n5846:    \"\"\"Дельты текста ответа -> (content, tool_calls в формате OpenAI).\n5866:    parser = _new_tool_call_parser(pieces.append, add_call)\n5940:def parse_opencode_event(event: dict[str, Any]) -> tuple[str, dict[str, Any]]:\n6274:def _strip_unclosed_tool_calls(text: str) -> str:\n6275:    \"\"\"Отрезать сырые `<tool_call>{…` после последнего закрывающего тега: они не закрыты и травят few-shot.\n6300:    text = _strip_unclosed_tool_calls(text)\n6558:                text = _strip_broken_tool_blocks(_split_tool_calls(chunks)[0])[0]\n6838:                    ) or etype in (\"tool_use\", \"tool_call\"):\n6844:                        etype in (\"tool_use\", \"tool_call\")\n6871:                            _native_to_tool_calls(\n            if prompt_status.get(\"protocol_error\"):\n                result[\"exit_reason\"] = \"invalid_serve_event\"\n                return result\n            now = time.monotonic()\n            # Раздельные таймауты: TTFT до первого токена, Idle между чанками после него.\n            if (\n                result[\"first_token_at\"] is None\n                and now - prompt_send_start >= ttft_timeout\n            ) or (\n                result[\"first_token_at\"] is not None\n                and _zen_idle_expired(\n                    now, last_token_at, idle_timeout, tool_state.has_active()\n                )\n            ):\n                result[\"exit_reason\"] = \"timeout\"\n                result[\"delivered\"] = _is_delivered()\n                break\n            if prompt_status.get(\"aux_exhausted\") or (\n                result[\"first_event_at\"] is None and now >= first_event_deadline\n            ):\n                result[\"exit_reason\"] = (\n                    \"timeout\"\n                    if prompt_status.get(\"aux_exhausted\")\n                    or first_event_deadline < first_event_limit\n                    else \"first_event_timeout\"\n                )\n                result[\"delivered\"] = _is_delivered()\n                return result\n            if (\n                result[\"first_event_at\"] is not None\n                and result[\"first_token_at\"] is None\n                and now - prompt_send_start > float(FIRST_TOKEN_TIMEOUT_S)\n            ):\n                result[\"exit_reason\"] = \"first_token_timeout\"\n                result[\"delivered\"] = True\n                return result\n            if result[\"first_token_at\"] is not None and now - last_token_at > float(\n                STALL_TIMEOUT_S\n            ):\n                result[\"exit_reason\"] = \"stall_timeout\"\n                result[\"delivered\"] = True\n                return result\n            # Классификация HTTP-статуса prompt по FALLBACK_DECISION_TABLE до ожидания SSE-события.\n            _ps = prompt_status.get(\"status\")\n            if isinstance(_ps, int) and _ps != 200 and result[\"prompt_status\"] is None:\n                result[\"prompt_status\"] = _ps\n                if _ps in (401, 403):\n                    raise ServeSecurityError(f\"serve prompt HTTP {_ps}\")\n                if _ps in (400, 404, 422):\n                    raise ServeSecurityError(f\"serve prompt HTTP {_ps}\")\n                _delivered_now = _is_delivered()\n                    last_token_at = time.monotonic()\n                    on_text(text_value)\n            elif etype == \"tool_event\":\n                if etype_raw == \"session.tool.input.delta\":\n                    last_token_at = time.monotonic()\n                tool_state.feed(payload)\n                accumulated_bytes = _serve_accumulated_bytes(\n                    accumulated_bytes, etype, payload, tool_state\n                )\n                call_id = str(payload.get(\"id\") or \"\")\n                if etype_raw in (\n                    \"session.tool.called\",\n                    \"session.tool.failed\",\n                    \"session.tool.success\",\n                ):\n                    done = tool_state.complete(call_id, etype_raw)\n                    if done is not None:\n                        last_token_at = time.monotonic()\n                        pending_step_calls.append(done[1])\n                        if result[\"first_token_at\"] is None:\n                            result[\"first_token_at\"] = time.monotonic()\n                            result[\"ttft_ms\"] = int(\n                                ((result[\"first_token_at\"] or 0.0) - t0) * 1000\n                            )\n                        if emulate_tools:\n                            _acc_box = [accumulated_bytes]\n                            _ = _finish_serve_tool_step(\n                                events,\n                                session_id,\n                                data_raw.get(\"assistantMessageID\")\n                                or current_step_msg_id\n                                or None,\n                                min(deadline, time.monotonic() + _STEP_DRAIN_WINDOW_S),\n                                tool_state,\n                                result,\n                                on_tool,\n                                _release_event,\n                                attempt_deadline=deadline,\n                    seen_steps.add(step_key)\n                # payload шага после _map не несёт assistantMessageID: ключ из data_raw выше.\n                for key in (\"input\", \"output\", \"cached\", \"reasoning\"):\n                    result[\"usage\"][key] = result[\"usage\"].get(key, 0) + _as_int(\n                        payload.get(key)\n                    )\n                # Завершить native вызовы без called: аргументы из input.ended.text.\n                for call_id in list(tool_state.tools):\n                    done = tool_state.complete(call_id, etype_raw)\n                    if done is not None:\n                        last_token_at = time.monotonic()\n                        pending_step_calls.append(done[1])\n                # step_finish — это session.step.ended: pending публикуется один раз.\n                for pending_call in pending_step_calls:\n                    result[\"native_calls\"].append(pending_call)\n                    on_tool(pending_call)\n                pending_step_calls.clear()\n                if result[\"native_calls\"] or (\n                    emulate_tools and _split_tool_calls([\"\".join(result[\"texts\"])])[1]\n                ):\n                    if result[\"first_token_at\"] is None and result[\"native_calls\"]:\n                        result[\"first_token_at\"] = time.monotonic()\n                        result[\"ttft_ms\"] = int(\n                            ((result[\"first_token_at\"] or 0.0) - t0) * 1000\n                        )\n                    result[\"terminal\"] = \"tool_calls\"\n                    break\n            elif etype == \"error\":\n                result[\"error\"] = payload\n                result[\"delivered\"] = _is_delivered()\n                result[\"transient_error\"] = _is_transient_stream_error(payload)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '5940,6070p' bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py; python3 - <<'PY'\nimport ast\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py')\nt=ast.parse(p.read_text())\nnodes=[n for n in t.body if isinstance(n, (ast.FunctionDef,ast.ClassDef)) and n.name in ('_as_dict','_ToolActivity')]\nns={}\nexec(compile(ast.Module(body=nodes,type_ignores=[]),str(p),'exec'),ns)\na=ns['_ToolActivity']()\nfor status in ('running','running','completed'):\n a.observe('tool_use', {'part': {'tool':'bash','state':{'status':status}}})\n print(status, bool(a))\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '5940,6070p' bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py; python3 - <<'PY'\nimport ast\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py')\nt=ast.parse(p.read_text())\nnodes=[n for n in t.body if isinstance(n, (ast.FunctionDef,ast.ClassDef)) and n.name in ('_as_dict','_ToolActivity')]\nns={}\nexec(compile(ast.Module(body=nodes,type_ignores=[]),str(p),'exec'),ns)\na=ns['_ToolActivity']()\nfor status in ('running','running','completed'):\n a.observe('tool_use', {'part': {'tool':'bash','state':{'status':status}}})\n print(status, bool(a))\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"def parse_opencode_event(event: dict[str, Any]) -> tuple[str, dict[str, Any]]:\n    \"\"\"Разбор одного события `opencode run` для чанков OpenAI SSE / non-stream.\"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(event, dict):\n        return \"\", {}\n    etype = str(event.get(\"type\") or \"\").strip()\n    part = _dict_or_empty(event.get(\"part\"))\n\n    if etype == \"reasoning\":\n        rtext = part.get(\"text\")\n        meta = _dict_or_empty(part.get(\"metadata\"))\n        openai_meta = _dict_or_empty(meta.get(\"openai\"))\n        enc_data = openai_meta.get(\"reasoningEncryptedContent\")\n\n        delta: dict[str, Any] = {}\n        if isinstance(rtext, str) and rtext:\n            delta[\"reasoning_content\"] = rtext\n        if isinstance(enc_data, str) and enc_data:\n            delta[\"reasoning_details\"] = [\n                {\"type\": \"reasoning.encrypted\", \"data\": enc_data}\n            ]\n        return (\"reasoning\", delta)\n\n    if etype == \"text\":\n        ttext = part.get(\"text\")\n        if isinstance(ttext, str) and ttext:\n            return (\"text\", {\"content\": ttext})\n        return (\"text\", {})\n\n    if etype == \"step_finish\":\n        tokens = _dict_or_empty(part.get(\"tokens\"))\n        return (\"step_finish\", tokens)\n\n    if etype == \"error\":\n        err_obj = event.get(\"error\")\n        if not isinstance(err_obj, dict):\n            err_obj = {\"message\": str(err_obj)}\n        data = err_obj.get(\"data\")\n        if isinstance(data, dict):\n            message = str(data.get(\"message\") or err_obj.get(\"message\") or err_obj)\n            status = data.get(\"statusCode\")\n        else:\n            message = str(err_obj.get(\"message\") or err_obj)\n            status = None\n        if \"provider.no-route\" in message or \"Variant unavailable\" in message:\n            status = 400\n        return (\"error\", {\"statusCode\": status, \"message\": message})\n\n    return (etype, {})\n\n\ndef format_sse_chunk(\n    resp_id: str,\n    created: int,\n    model: str,\n    delta: dict[str, Any],\n    finish_reason: str | None = None,\n    usage: dict[str, Any] | None = None,\n) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Форматирование одного SSE-события OpenAI чанка.\"\"\"\n    choice: dict[str, Any] = {\"index\": 0, \"delta\": delta}\n    if finish_reason is not None:\n        choice[\"finish_reason\"] = finish_reason\n    chunk: dict[str, Any] = {\n        \"id\": resp_id,\n        \"object\": \"chat.completion.chunk\",\n        \"created\": created,\n        \"model\": model,\n        \"choices\": [choice],\n    }\n    if usage is not None:\n        chunk[\"usage\"] = usage\n    return \"data: \" + json.dumps(chunk, ensure_ascii=False) + \"\\n\\n\"\n\n\ndef _resolve_opencode_go_auth() -> tuple[str, str]:\n    \"\"\"Читать активную учётную запись заново на каждом запросе без записи в БД.\"\"\"\n    token = \"\"\n    org_id = os.environ.get(\"OPENCODE_ORG_ID\", \"org_01M4ZR9TJ6XN1X4MS79ADKQJ60\").strip()\n    db_path = Path.home() / \".local/share/opencode/opencode.db\"\n    try:\n        conn = sqlite3.connect(\n            f\"file:{quote(str(db_path))}?mode=ro\", uri=True, timeout=5\n        )\n        try:\n            try:\n                row = conn.execute(\n                    \"SELECT a.access_token, s.active_org_id FROM account_state s \"\n                    \"JOIN account a ON a.id = s.active_account_id LIMIT 1\"\n                ).fetchone()\n            except sqlite3.Error:\n                row = None\n            if row and row[0]:\n                token = str(row[0]).strip()\n                org_id = str(row[1] or org_id).strip()\n        finally:\n            conn.close()\n    except (sqlite3.Error, OSError):\n        pass\n    return token or os.environ.get(\"OPENCODE_GO_API_KEY\", \"\").strip(), org_id\n\n\ndef _is_google_direct_model(model_id: str) -> bool:\n    return bool(\n        ALLOWED_MODELS.get(model_id, {})\n        .get(\"base_url\", \"\")\n        .rstrip(\"/\")\n        .endswith(\"/v1beta\")\n    )\n\n\nGOOGLE_STOP_SEQUENCES = [\"\\nUser:\", \"\\n[tool result \"]\nGOOGLE_CONTINUE_TEXT = \"Continue.\"\n\n\ndef _messages_to_google_contents(\n    messages: list[dict[str, Any]], system_head: str\n) -> tuple[list[dict[str, Any]], str]:\n    \"\"\"История OpenAI -> (contents user/model, systemInstruction) без разбора плоского текста.\n\n    Разделители «User: »/«Assistant: » внутри текста сообщений остаются содержимым;\n    system/developer уже собраны в system_head. Соседние реплики одной роли склеиваются\n    в parts одного content (tool-результаты идут как user).\n    \"\"\"\n    contents: list[dict[str, Any]] = []\n    for msg in messages or []:\n        if not isinstance(msg, dict):\n            continue\n        role, text = _render_turn(msg)\n        if not text.strip() or role in (\"system\", \"developer\"):\n            continue\n        google_role = \"model\" if role == \"assistant\" else \"user\"\nrunning True\nrunning True\ncompleted False\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"PANEL-NONCE: a0d1ccfc7bb54b66\nARTIFACT-SHA256: 50eaf21d2d799b7469d428a6ba845ba4e8771643e10fc252c63e0be1d83914c0\nDISPUTE RW-010 — контр-evidence: bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py:335 — TIMEOUT_S настраивается через OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_TIMEOUT_S; min сохраняет конфигурируемый глобальный предел, прямо предусмотренный требованиями; отсутствие конфиг-объекта само по себе дефект не доказывает.\nAGREE RW-011 — проверил: bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py:5060 — начальный tool_event в serve не устанавливает first_token_at, поэтому активный tool может оборваться по TTFT; Run устанавливает его при tool_use/tool_call на строке 6838, стриминговый путь — на 8516. Семантика действительно расходится.\nAGREE RW-012 — проверил: bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py:413 — при отсутствии callID/id ключом становится имя инструмента; воспроизвёл running/bash → running/bash → completed/bash: активность False, хотя второй вызов ещё исполняется. Для разных непустых ID коллапса нет.\nVERDICT: NEEDS WORK"}}
